## App flow
```
Visit proflet.com
  → Landing page (dark, hamburger menu on mobile, demo video)
  → Click Get Started
  → Auth (login/signup)
  → App.jsx checks subscriptions table
  → No active subscription → Paywall (£19/year)
  → Stripe checkout → stripe-webhook → subscriptions updated
  → Welcome email sent
  → Success.jsx → redirects to Dashboard
  → Active subscription → Dashboard
  → /reset-password → ResetPassword.jsx
```

